] [[next to]] [[the]] [[old]] [[photo]]. [[It]] [[was|be]] [[surprising]]. [[There]] [[were|be]] [[fifty]] [[years|year]] [[between]] [[them]], [[but]] [[it]] [[was|be]] [[clearly]] [[the]] [[same]] [[laugh]]. \`[[It]] [[is|be]] Grandma Sau,\` [[said|say]] Mr Nghia. \`[[She]] [[was|be]] [[very]] [[attractive]], [[and]] [[very]] [[loud]]. [[She]] [[still]] [[is|be]].\``,`vn`:`C\u00f4 \u0111\u1eb7t t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh th\u1ee9 m\u01b0\u1eddi hai c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh c\u1ea1nh t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh c\u0169. Th\u1eadt b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd. Hai t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh c\u00e1ch nhau n\u0103m m\u01b0\u01a1i n\u0103m, v\u1eady m\u00e0 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u1eabn l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t n\u1ee5 c\u01b0\u1eddi \u1ea5y. \`L\u00e0 b\u00e0 S\u00e1u \u0111\u1ea5y,\` \u00f4ng Ngh\u0129a n\u00f3i. \`H\u1ed3i \u1ea5y b\u00e0 \u1ea5y xinh l\u1eafm, l\u1ea1i n\u00f3i to n\u1eefa. Gi\u1edd v\u1eabn th\u1ebf.\``},{`en`:`[[It]] [[was|be]] [[dark]] [[when]] [[they]] [[took|take]] [[the]] [[photo]] [[to]] Grandma Sau. [[She]] [[looked|look]] [[at]] [[it]] [[for]] [[a]] [[long]] [[time]]. [[Her]] [[face]] [[was|be]] [[strange]], [[happy]] [[and]] [[sad]] [[at]] [[the]] [[same]] [[time]]. [[Then]] [[she]] [[looked|look]] [[up]]. \`Nghia,\` [[she]] [[said|say]]. \`[[I]] [[waited|wait]] [[fifty]] [[years|year]] [[for]] [[this]] [[photo]]. [[Why]] [[did|do]] [[you]] [[never]] [[bring]] [[it]]?\``,`vn`:`Tr\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 t\u1ed1i khi hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi mang t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00e0 b\u00e0 S\u00e1u. B\u00e0 ng\u1eafm n\u00f3 r\u1ea5t l\u00e2u. G\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1eb7t b\u00e0 l\u1ea1 l\u1eafm, v\u1eeba vui l\u1ea1i v\u1eeba bu\u1ed3n. R\u1ed3i b\u00e0 ng\u1ea9ng l\u00ean. \`Ngh\u0129a n\u00e0y,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. \`T\u00f4i ch\u1edd t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh n\u00e0y n\u0103m m\u01b0\u01a1i n\u0103m r\u1ed3i. Sao c\u1eadu ch\u1eb3ng bao gi\u1edd mang \u0111\u1ebfn?\``}],`tease`:`V\u00ec sao \u00f4ng Ngh\u0129a c\u1ea5t t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh c\u01b0\u1edbi su\u1ed1t n\u0103m m\u01b0\u01a1i n\u0103m m\u00e0 kh